# Scenario: a Horns pick-and-roll with the skip pass. 5 screens for 1 and rolls to the rim while 4 pops to the left slot; when 2's defender leaves the corner to tag the roller, 1 skips the ball to 2 for an open corner three.
playbook "Horns Pick-and-Roll: Skip to the Corner" sport basketball
set horns
defense man
screen 5 1
dribble 1 to rwing
cut 5 rim
cut 4 lslot
cut X2 lblock
pass 1 2
